      "summary": "Kliff's campaign: a prologue, twelve chapters and an epilogue, played in a fixed order.",
      "body": "GameRant's published list names 206 main quests across fourteen sections; this record holds all 206. The campaign is linear. The companion research (docs/RESEARCH-COMPANION.md) places the opening Greymane camp in Pailune; the main-story research places it in Hernand, so the six prologue quests omit a region. Journey's End is treated as the first Epilogue quest, not as the close of Chapter 12. The four trial lines after The Calling can be taken in any order; sources suggest Shattered Ties, then Veiled Witch, then Thinning Blade, then Six Pensive Statues and the Evil Spirit.",
